type: dataset
keywords:
  - blood group antigens
  - Rh
  - RHD
  - non-coding variants
  - base editing
abstract: >
  A curated database of non-coding and regulatory variants in the human RHD
  gene (Rh blood group system, ISBT 004), compiled from primary literature,
  ISBT allele tables, RhesusBase, and RHeference, annotated with gnomAD/TOPMed
  population frequencies, validation evidence tiers, and CRISPR base-editing
  (BE4max/ABE8e) feasibility.
